Notes on provenance:

* The ASCII portrait pipeline in scripts/make_portrait.py started from the
  "ASCII Portrait README Guide" published on Notion
  (https://burly-handstand-0dc.notion.site/ASCII-Portrait-README-Guide-3a3e3f86338481f0b545ec8120bbf604),
  whose author is unknown to me and which carries no license of its own. The
  darkening curve, background removal, font embedding and everything outside
  that script are mine and covered by the MIT license above.
* The JetBrains Mono subsets in scripts/fonts are distributed under the SIL
  Open Font License 1.1, see scripts/fonts/OFL.txt.
